WEBVTT

1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:02,400
The most terrible thing about this low-quality coal is the flow inside it.

2
00:00:02,400 --> 00:00:04,600
When it burns, it emits a highly toxic gas

3
00:00:04,600 --> 00:00:07,000
That's the poisonous gas you're talking about that kills people.

4
00:00:07,000 --> 00:00:09,000
But this poisonous gas is afraid of quicklime

5
00:00:09,000 --> 00:00:10,800
When not burning in high temperature

6
00:00:10,800 --> 00:00:13,000
As soon as the poisonous gas came out, it hit the quicklime

7
00:00:13,000 --> 00:00:14,000
Two and one reaction

8
00:00:14,000 --> 00:00:16,600
It becomes a safe and non-toxic thing

9
00:00:16,600 --> 00:00:18,200
Clinging to the burnt ashes

10
00:00:18,200 --> 00:00:19,400
I can't escape and harm others.

11
00:00:19,400 --> 00:00:22,200
What covers and flows are all these things

12
00:00:22,200 --> 00:00:23,400
It doesn’t matter if you don’t understand

13
00:00:23,400 --> 00:00:24,400
You just need to remember

14
00:00:24,400 --> 00:00:25,800
Added this white powder

15
00:00:25,800 --> 00:00:27,800
This coal won't be poisonous when burned.

16
00:00:27,800 --> 00:00:29,400
People burn it in the house

17
00:00:29,400 --> 00:00:31,200
Sleep peacefully

18
00:00:31,200 --> 00:00:32,800
There won't be a second family that is smoked to death.

19
00:00:32,800 --> 00:00:33,800
This is another thing to do

20
00:00:33,800 --> 00:00:35,200
A good pancake

21
00:00:35,200 --> 00:00:37,400
Have you poked so many holes?

22
00:00:37,400 --> 00:00:39,800
The holes are poked to let the fire burn through

23
00:00:39,800 --> 00:00:42,000
You see these holes go up and down

24
00:00:42,000 --> 00:00:43,000
Light the fire

25
00:00:43,000 --> 00:00:44,600
Hot air flows upwards through the holes

26
00:00:44,600 --> 00:00:45,800
cold air below

27
00:00:45,800 --> 00:00:48,000
Then it was pulled up from the hole and filled in.

28
00:00:48,000 --> 00:00:49,000
Take this one and make up for it

29
00:00:49,000 --> 00:00:51,030
The wind started running by itself in the hole

30
00:00:51,030 --> 00:00:53,030
This is called the smoky onion effect
